<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Biblica® Open Luganda Contemporary Bible 2014</book>
  <para style="h">Abaggalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebbaluwa ya Pawulo Omutukuvu eri Abaggalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Abaggalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bag</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ebbaluwa ya Pawulo Omutukuvu eri</para>
  <para style="mt1">Abaggalatiya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1"/>Nze Pawulo omutume, ataatumibwa bantu wadde omuntu, wabula eyatumibwa Yesu Kristo ne Katonda Kitaffe, eyamuzuukiza mu bafu, <verse eid="GAL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2"/>awamu n’abooluganda bonna abali nange tuwandiikira ekkanisa ez’e Ggalatiya, <verse eid="GAL 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3"/>nga tugamba nti ekisa n’emirembe ebiva eri Katonda Kitaffe n’eri Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo bibeerenga nammwe; <verse eid="GAL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4"/>Kristo oyo eyeewaayo ku lw’ebibi byaffe, alyoke atununule mu mulembe guno omubi ng’okwagala kwa Katonda, era Kitaffe bwe kuli, <verse eid="GAL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5"/>aweebwe ekitiibwa emirembe n’emirembe. Amiina.<verse eid="GAL 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tewali Njiri Ndala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6"/>Naye mbeewuunya kubanga mukyuka mangu okuva ku oyo, eyabayita olw’ekisa kya Kristo, naye ne mukyuka mangu okugoberera Enjiri endala. <verse eid="GAL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7"/>Kubanga tewali njiri ndala, wabula mwawubisibwa abaagala okunyoola n’okukyusa Enjiri ya Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8"/>Omuntu yenna, ne bwe tuba ffe, wadde malayika ava mu ggulu, bw’abuuliranga Enjiri okuggyako gye twababuulira, akolimirwenga. <verse eid="GAL 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9"/>Nga bwe twasooka okwogera, bwe ntyo nziramu okukyogera nti, omuntu yenna bw’ababuulira Enjiri eteri eyo ggye mwakkiriza akolimirwenga.<verse eid="GAL 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10"/>Kale kaakano nkolerera kumatiza bantu oba kusiimibwa Katonda? Oba ngezaako kusanyusa bantu? Singa nnali nkyagezaako okusanyusa abantu, sandibadde muddu wa Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11"/>Kubanga abooluganda, mbategeeza nti, Enjiri gye nababuulira teyeesigamizibwa ku muntu, <verse eid="GAL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12"/>era nange saagiweebwa muntu wadde okusomesebwa omuntu wabula Yesu Kristo ye yagimbikkulira. <verse eid="GAL 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13"/>Mumanyi nga bwe nnali nfaanana nga nkyagoberera eddiini y’Ekiyudaaya, nga bwe nayigganyanga ennyo Ekkanisa ya Katonda okugizikiza, <verse eid="GAL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14"/>era nga nnali omu ku bannaddiini abaakulaakulana mu ggwanga lyange, ne nsukkuluma ku Bayudaaya bannange be nakula nabo, era nagezaako nnyo nga bwe nasobola okugoberera empisa zonna ez’edda ez’amateeka g’eddiini yange. <verse eid="GAL 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15"/>Naye Katonda bwe yasiima, eyanjawula okuva mu lubuto lwa mmange, n’ampita olw’ekisa kye, <verse eid="GAL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16"/>n’ambikkulira Omwana we ndyoke ŋŋende eri Abaamawanga mbabuulire Enjiri era sseebuuza ku muntu n’omu, <verse eid="GAL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17"/>newaakubadde okwambuka e Yerusaalemi okwebuuza ku batume, naye nagenda mu Buwalabu era oluvannyuma ne nkomawo e Damasiko.<verse eid="GAL 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18"/>Awo bwe waayitawo emyaka esatu ne ŋŋenda e Yerusaalemi okulaba Keefa ne mmala naye ennaku kkumi na ttaano. <verse eid="GAL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19"/>Naye ssaalaba mutume mulala wabula Yakobo muganda wa Mukama waffe. <verse eid="GAL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20"/>Noolwekyo bye mbawandiikira, si bya bulimba mu maaso ga Katonda.<verse eid="GAL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21"/>Bwe navaayo ne ndaga mu bitundu eby’e Siriya n’eby’e Kirukiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22"/>Era ekkanisa za Kristo mu Buyudaaya zaali tezinnategeera bwe nfaanana. <verse eid="GAL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23"/>Naye nga bamanyi nti, “Eyatuyigganyanga, kaakano abuulira okukkiriza kwe yagezaako okuzikiriza.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24"/>Era ne bagulumiza Katonda ku lwange.<verse eid="GAL 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo Ayanirizibwa Abatume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1"/>Bwe waayitawo emyaka kkumi n’ena ne nzirayo ne Balunabba ne Tito e Yerusaalemi. <verse eid="GAL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2"/>Nagendayo olw’okubikulirwa kwe nafuna, ne mbanjulira Enjiri gye mbuulira Abaamawanga. Nayogera n’abakulembeze b’Ekkanisa mu kyama balyoke bategeere bye njigiriza, si kulwa nga nteganira bwereere, ne bakkiriza nti bituufu. <verse eid="GAL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3"/>Tito gwe nnali naye ne batamuwaliriza kukomolebwa, newaakubadde nga yali munnaggwanga. <verse eid="GAL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4"/>Naye olw’abooluganda ab’obulimba abaayingizibwa mu kyama okuketta eddembe lye tulina mu Kristo Yesu, balyoke batufuule abaddu, <verse eid="GAL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5"/>abo tetwabawuliriza essaawa n’emu, amazima g’enjiri galyoke geeyongerenga mu mmwe.<verse eid="GAL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6"/>Naye abo abaabalibwa ng’okuba ekintu eky’omuwendo, abataaliko bwe baali gye ndi kubanga Katonda tasosola mu bantu, nze gye ndi tebalina kye bannyongerako, <verse eid="GAL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7"/>naye mu ngeri endala bwe baalaba nga nateresebwa Enjiri ey’abatali bakomole, nga Peetero bwe yateresebwa ey’abakomole, <verse eid="GAL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8"/>oyo eyakolera mu Peetero olw’obutume bw’abakomole, ye yakolera ne mu nze ku lw’Abaamawanga. <verse eid="GAL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9"/>Yakobo ne Keefa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Keefa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ye Simooni Peetero</char></note> ne Yokaana abaalabikanga ng’empagi bwe baalaba ekisa ekya mpeebwa, ne batukwata mu ngalo eza ddyo nze ne Balunabba nga bassa kimu naffe nti ffe tubeere mu Bamawanga, naye bo babeere mu b’abakomole. <verse eid="GAL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10"/>Kye baatusaba kyokka tujjukirenga abaavu, ate ng’ekyo kye nnali nesunga okukola.<verse eid="GAL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo Anenya Peetero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11"/>Naye Peetero ate era nga ye Keefa, bwe yajja mu Antiyokiya ne mmunenya mu lwatu kubanga yali mukyamu. <verse eid="GAL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12"/>Kubanga abaava eri Yakobo bwe baali tebannajja, yalyanga n’Abamawanga, naye bwe bajja n’atandika okubeeyawulako ng’atya abakomole. <verse eid="GAL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13"/>Abayudaaya abalala bonna ne bamwegattako mu bukuusa, ekyo ne kireetera ne Balunabba okusendebwasendebwa obukuusa bwabwe.<verse eid="GAL 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14"/>Naye bwe nalaba nga tebatambula bulungi ng’amazima g’enjiri bwe gali, ne ŋŋamba Keefa mu maaso gaabwe bonna nti, “Obanga ggwe Omuyudaaya ogoberera empisa z’Abamawanga ezitali za Kiyudaaya, owaliriza otya Abaamawanga okugobereranga empisa z’Ekiyudaaya?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15"/>Ffe mu buzaaliranwa tuli Bayudaaya so si Bamawanga aboonoonyi. <verse eid="GAL 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16"/>Kyokka tukimanyi bulungi nti omuntu taweebwa butuukirivu lwa kugondera mateeka, wabula abufuna lwa kukkiriza Yesu Kristo, era naffe kyetwava tukkiriza Yesu Kristo tulyoke tuweebwe obutuukirivu olw’okumukkiriza so si lwa kugondera mateeka. Kubanga tewali n’omu aliweebwa obutuukirivu olw’ebikolwa eby’amateeka.<verse eid="GAL 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17"/>Naye oba nga bwe twanoonya okuweebwa obutuukirivu mu Kristo twasangibwa okuba aboonoonyi, kitegeeza nti Kristo muweereza wa kibi? Kikafuuwe. <verse eid="GAL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18"/>Kubanga bwe nzimba nate bye nazikiriza, nneeraga nzekka okuba omwonoonyi. <verse eid="GAL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19"/>Kubanga olw’amateeka nnafa eri mateeka, ndyoke mbeere omulamu mu Katonda. Nakomererwa wamu ne Kristo; <verse eid="GAL 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20"/>kyokka ndi mulamu, si ku bwange, wabula ku bwa Kristo abeera mu nze; era obulamu bwe nnina kaakano mu mubiri, mbulina lwa kukkiriza Omwana wa Katonda, eyanjagala ne yeewaayo yekka ku lwange. <verse eid="GAL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21"/>Ssidibya kisa kya Katonda; naye oba nga obutuukirivu buva mu mateeka, nga Kristo yafiira bwereere.<verse eid="GAL 2:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Kukkiriza oba Kukuuma Mateeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1"/>Mmwe Abaggalatiya abatalina magezi ani eyabaloga, so nga nabannyonnyola bulungi Yesu Kristo eyakomererwa ku musaalaba ne mukitegeera? <verse eid="GAL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2"/>Kino kyokka kye njagala muntegeeze; mwaweebwa Mwoyo lwa bikolwa eby’amateeka, nantiki lwa kuwulira kwa kukkiriza? <verse eid="GAL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3"/>Muyinza mutya obutaba na magezi kutuuka awo, abaatandikira mu Mwoyo, kaakano mutuukirizibwa mu mubiri? <verse eid="GAL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4"/>Okubonaabona kwonna kwe mwabonaabona kwali kwa bwereere? Bwe kuba nga ddala kwa bwereere. <verse eid="GAL 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5"/>Abawa Omwoyo n’abawa n’okukola eby’amaanyi mu mmwe, akola lwa bikolwa by’amateeka oba lwa kuwulira olw’okukkiriza? <verse eid="GAL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6"/>Ibulayimu yakkiriza Katonda ne kimubalirwa okuba obutuukirivu.<verse eid="GAL 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7"/>Kale mumanye nti abo abakkiriza be baana ba Ibulayimu. <verse eid="GAL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8"/>Olw’okuba nga baategeera ebiribaawo n’ekyawandiikibwa, ng’olw’okukkiriza, Katonda aliwa amawanga obutuukirivu, Enjiri kyeyava ebuulirwa Ibulayimu edda nti, “Mu ggwe amawanga gonna mwe galiweerwa omukisa.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9"/>Noolwekyo abo abakkiriza bagabanira wamu omukisa ne Ibulayimu eyakkiriza.<verse eid="GAL 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10"/>Naye abo abafugibwa ebikolwa eby’amateeka, bafugibwa kikolimo; kubanga kyawandiikibwa nti, “Buli ataagobererenga byonna ebiwandiikiddwa mu kitabo ky’amateeka, akolimiddwa.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11"/>Kimanyiddwa bulungi nti tewali n’omu Katonda gw’awa butuukirivu olw’okukuuma amateeka, kubanga abatuukirivu banaabeeranga balamu lwa kukkiriza, <verse eid="GAL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12"/>naye amateeka tegeesigama ku kukkiriza, naye anaagagobereranga anaabeeranga mulamu mu go. <verse eid="GAL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13"/>Kristo yatununula okuva mu kikolimo ky’amateeka, bwe yafuuka ekikolimo ku lwaffe, kubanga kyawandiikibwa nti, “Akolimiddwa buli awanikiddwa ku muti.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14"/>Kale kaakano amawanga gaweebwe omukisa gwa Ibulayimu, mu Kristo Yesu, tulyoke tuweebwe ekyasuubizibwa eky’Omwoyo olw’okukkiriza.<verse eid="GAL 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Etteeka n’Ekisuubizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15"/>Abooluganda njogera mu buntu; endagaano bw’eba ng’ekakasibbwa, tewabaawo agiggyawo newaakubadde agyongerako. <verse eid="GAL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16"/>Katonda yasuubiza Ibulayimu n’Omwana we, naye tekigamba nti n’abaana be ng’abangi, naye yayogera ku omu, oyo ye Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17"/>Kye ŋŋamba kye kino: endagaano eyakakasibwa Katonda nga wayiseewo emyaka ebikumi bina mu asatu n’efuuka etteeka, teyadibya ekyo ekyasuubizibwa. <verse eid="GAL 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18"/>Kuba oba ng’obusika bwesigamye ku mateeka, buba tebukyali bwa kisuubizo; naye yabuwa Ibulayimu olw’okusuubiza.<verse eid="GAL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19"/>Kale lwaki amateeka gaateekebwawo? Gaagattibwa ku kisuubizo olw’aboonoonyi okutuusa ezzadde eryasuubizibwa lwe lirikomawo, nga lyawulibbwa mu bamalayika olw’omukono gw’omutabaganya. <verse eid="GAL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20"/>Naye omutabaganya si w’omu, naye Katonda ali omu.<verse eid="GAL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21"/>Amateeka galwanagana n’ebyo Katonda bye yasuubiza? Kikafuuwe. Kubanga singa amateeka gaali galeeta obulamu, ddala ddala amateeka gandituwadde obutuukirivu. <verse eid="GAL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22"/>Naye ebyawandiikibwa bitegeeza nti ebintu byonna bifugibwa kibi, ekyasuubizibwa kiryoke kiweebwe abakkiriza olw’okukkiriza mu Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="GAL 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23"/>Naye okukkiriza nga tekunnajja, twafugibwanga mateeka, nga tusibibwa olw’okukkiriza okugenda okubikkulwa; <verse eid="GAL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24"/>ge gaali gatukuuma, amateeka galyoke gatutuuse eri Kristo, tulyoke tuweebwe obutuukirivu olw’okumukkiriza. <verse eid="GAL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25"/>Naye okukkiriza bwe kwajja, ng’olwo tetukyetaaga mateeka kutukuuma.<verse eid="GAL 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baana ba Katonda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26"/>Kubanga kaakano mwenna muli baana ba Katonda olw’okukkiriza Yesu Kristo, <verse eid="GAL 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27"/>kubanga abaabatizibwa bonna mu Kristo, baayambala Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28"/>Tewakyali kusosola wakati wa Muyudaaya na Muyonaani, wakati wa muddu na wa ddembe, wakati wa musajja na mukazi, kubanga mwenna muli omu mu Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29"/>Kale kaakano nga bwe muli aba Kristo, muli zadde lya Ibulayimu, ng’ekisuubizo ky’abasika bwe kiri.<verse eid="GAL 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1"/>Naye ŋŋamba nti omusika bw’aba ng’akyali mwana muto, tayawulwa na muddu, newaakubadde nga ye mukama wa byonna. <verse eid="GAL 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2"/>Afugibwa abasigire n’abawanika okutuusa lw’akula n’atuuka ku kigero kitaawe, kye yategeka. <verse eid="GAL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3"/>Era naffe bwe tutyo bwe twali tukyali bato, twafugibwanga obulombolombo obw’ensi. <verse eid="GAL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4"/>Naye ekiseera bwe kyatuuka, Katonda n’atuma Omwana we <verse eid="GAL 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5"/>eyazaalibwa omukazi ng’afugibwa amateeka, tulyoke tufuuke abaana. <verse eid="GAL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6"/>Era kubanga tuli baana, Katonda yatuma Omwoyo w’Omwana we okubeera mu mitima gyaffe, era kaakano tuyinza okwogera mu ddoboozi ery’omwanguka nti, “<char style="tl">Aba,</char> Kitaffe.” <verse eid="GAL 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7"/>Kale kaakano tokyali muddu, wabula oli mwana; era nga bw’oli omwana oli musika ku bwa Katonda.<verse eid="GAL 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo Alowooza ku Baggalatiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8"/>Mmwe bwe mwali temunnamanya Katonda mwabanga baddu ba bitali Katonda. <verse eid="GAL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9"/>Naye kaakano mutegedde Katonda era naye abategedde, kale muyinza mutya okukyuka, ne mugoberera obulombolombo obunafu obutalina maanyi ne mwagala okufuuka abaddu baabwo? <verse eid="GAL 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10"/>Mukwata ennaku, n’emyezi, n’ebiro, n’emyaka; <verse eid="GAL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11"/>neeraliikirira si kulwa ng’omulimu omunene gwe nakola mu mmwe gwali gwa bwereere.<verse eid="GAL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12"/>Abooluganda, mbeegayirira mubeere nga nze, kubanga nange ndi nga mmwe. Temulina kabi ke mwankola; <verse eid="GAL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13"/>era mumanyi nga mu bunafu obw’omubiri, mmwe be nasooka okubuulira Enjiri. <verse eid="GAL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14"/>Naye newaakubadde nga mwandinnyomye olw’obulwadde bwange, temwangobaganya, wabula mwansembeza nga malayika wa Katonda, nga Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15"/>Kale essanyu lyammwe lyadda wa? Kubanga ndi mujulirwa wammwe nti, mwali musobola okuggyamu amaaso gammwe ne mugampa okunnyamba singa kyali kyetaagisa. <verse eid="GAL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16"/>Kale kaakano nfuuse omulabe wammwe olw’okubategeeza amazima?<verse eid="GAL 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17"/>Abo abalabika ng’abaabassaako ennyo omwoyo tebabaagaliza birungi, okuggyako okwagala okubaggalira ebweru, mulyoke mudde ku luuyi lwabwe. <verse eid="GAL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18"/>Naye kirungi okunyiikiranga okukola ebirungi bulijjo, naye si lwe mbeera nammwe lwokka. <verse eid="GAL 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19"/>Baana bange be nnumirwa nate ng’alumwa okuzaala, okutuusa Kristo lw’alibumbibwa mu mmwe, <verse eid="GAL 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20"/>nandyagadde okubeera nammwe kaakano, n’okukyusa eddoboozi lyange kubanga ndi mweraliikirivu ku lwammwe.<verse eid="GAL 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Agali ne Saala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21"/>Mumbulire, mmwe abaagala okufugibwa amateeka, lwaki temuwulira mateeka? <verse eid="GAL 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22"/>Kubanga kyawandiikibwa nti Ibulayimu yazaala abaana babiri aboobulenzi, omu yamuzaala mu mukazi omuddu, n’omulala n’amuzaala mu mukazi ow’eddembe. <verse eid="GAL 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23"/>Omwana ow’omukazi omuddu yazaalibwa nga wa mubiri, naye omwana ow’omukazi ow’eddembe yazaalibwa lwa kusuubiza.<verse eid="GAL 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24"/>Ebyo biri nga bya lugero; kubanga ezo ndagaano bbiri. Emu yava ku Lusozi Sinaayi, ye yazaala abaana ab’obuddu, ye yava mu Agali. <verse eid="GAL 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25"/>Agali lwe Lusozi Sinaayi oluli mu Buwalabu, era afaananyirizibwa ne Yerusaalemi eya kaakano kubanga ye ne bazzukulu be bali mu buddu. <verse eid="GAL 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26"/>Naye Yerusaalemi eky’omu ggulu ye mukazi ow’eddembe, era ye nnyaffe. <verse eid="GAL 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27"/>Kubanga kyawandiikibwa nti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">“Sanyuka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">ggwe omugumba atazaala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Leekaanira waggulu mu ddoboozi ery’omwanguka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">newaakubadde nga tozaalanga ku mwana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Kubanga ndikuwa abaana bangi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">abaana abangi okusinga omukazi alina omusajja b’alina.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28"/>Naye mmwe abooluganda muli baana abaasuubizibwa, nga Isaaka bwe yali. <verse eid="GAL 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29"/>Naye mu biro biri ng’eyazaalibwa omubiri bwe yayigganya oyo eyazaalibwa Omwoyo, ne kaakano bwe kiri. <verse eid="GAL 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30"/>Naye Ebyawandiikibwa bigamba bitya? Bigamba nti, “Goba omukazi omuddu n’omwana we, kubanga omwana w’omukazi omuddu talisikira wamu n’omwana w’omukazi ow’eddembe.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31"/>Noolwekyo abooluganda tetuli baana ba mukazi omuddu naye tuli baana ab’omukazi ow’eddembe.<verse eid="GAL 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Eddembe mu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1"/>Kale nga Kristo bwe yatufuula ab’eddembe, bwe mutyo munywerere mu ddembe eryo muleme kusibwa nate mu kikoligo ky’obuddu.<verse eid="GAL 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2"/>Ka mbategeeze nze Pawulo: Bwe mukomolebwa, nga Kristo taliiko ky’abagasa. <verse eid="GAL 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3"/>Era nziramu okutegeeza buli muntu akomolebwa nti alina ebbanja okutuukiriza amateeka gonna. <verse eid="GAL 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4"/>Mwava mu Kristo mmwe abanoonya okufuna obutuukirivu olw’amateeka. Mwava mu kisa. <verse eid="GAL 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5"/>Kubanga ffe, ffe ku bw’Omwoyo olw’okukkiriza tulindirira n’essuubi obutuukirivu. <verse eid="GAL 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6"/>Kubanga mu Kristo Yesu, okukomolebwa oba obutakomolebwa, tekulina maanyi, wabula okukkiriza kukola olw’okwagala.<verse eid="GAL 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7"/>Mwali mutambula bulungi. Ani eyabasendasenda n’abaggya ku kugondera amazima? <verse eid="GAL 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8"/>Okusendebwasendebwa okwo, si kw’oyo eyabayita. <verse eid="GAL 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9"/>Ekizimbulukusa ekitono kizimbulukusa ekitole kyonna. <verse eid="GAL 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10"/>Mbeesiga mu Mukama waffe nga temujja kulowooza kintu kirala kyonna. Naye oyo abateganya alisalirwa omusango ne bw’aliba ani. <verse eid="GAL 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11"/>Naye nze abooluganda, oba nga nkyayigiriza okukomolebwa, lwaki njigganyizibwa? Kale enkonge ey’omusaalaba evuddewo. <verse eid="GAL 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12"/>Nnandyagadde abo abaabateganya beeraawe.<verse eid="GAL 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obulamu bw’Omwoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13"/>Kubanga mmwe abooluganda mwayitibwa lwa ddembe, noolwekyo eddembe teribawa bbeetu kugoberera bya mubiri. Naye olw’okwagala buli omu abeerenga muweereza wa munne. <verse eid="GAL 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14"/>Kubanga amateeka gonna gatuukirizibwa mu tteeka lino nti: “Yagalanga muntu munno nga bwe weeyagala wekka.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15"/>Naye obanga muneneŋŋana mwegendereze muleme okwezikiriza. <verse eid="GAL 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16"/>Mbagamba nti, mutambulirenga mu Mwoyo, mu ngeri yonna, mulemenga kutuukiriza kwegomba kwa mubiri. <verse eid="GAL 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17"/>Kubanga okwegomba kw’omubiri kulwanagana n’Omwoyo, n’Omwoyo n’alwanagana n’omubiri; kubanga bino byombi bikontana, mulemenga okukola bye mwagala. <verse eid="GAL 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18"/>Naye bwe muluŋŋamizibwa Omwoyo, olwo nga temukyafugibwa mateeka.<verse eid="GAL 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19"/>Ebikolwa by’omubiri bya lwatu, bye bino: obwenzi, obukaba, obugwenyufu, <verse eid="GAL 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20"/>Okusinza bakatonda abalala, obufumu, obulabe, okuyomba, obuggya, obusungu, okwekuluntaza, okweyawula, okwesalamu, <verse eid="GAL 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21"/>ettima, obutamiivu, ebinyumu, n’ebirala ebiri ng’ebyo. Ka mbategeeze nate nga bwe nasooka okubabuulira nti buli akola ebyo talina mugabo mu bwakabaka bwa Katonda.<verse eid="GAL 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22"/>Naye ebibala eby’Omwoyo bye bino: okwagala, essanyu, emirembe, obugumiikiriza, ekisa, obulungi, obwesigwa, <verse eid="GAL 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23"/>obuwombeefu, okwefuga; awali ebyo tewali tteeka libiwakanya. <verse eid="GAL 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24"/>N’abo aba Kristo Yesu baakomerera omubiri n’okwegomba kwagwo, n’omululu gwagwo. <verse eid="GAL 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25"/>Kale bwe tuba abalamu ku bw’Omwoyo, tugobererenga okuluŋŋamizibwa kw’Omwoyo. <verse eid="GAL 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26"/>Tulemenga okwemanya, n’okunyizaganya, n’okukwatiragananga obuggya.<verse eid="GAL 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1"/>Abooluganda omuntu bw’abanga alina ekibi ky’akoze, mmwe ab’omwoyo mumuluŋŋamyenga mu buwombeefu nga mwegendereza si kulwa nga nammwe mugwa mu kukemebwa. <verse eid="GAL 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2"/>Muyambaganenga, bwe mutyo bwe munaatuukirizanga etteeka lya Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3"/>Kubanga omuntu yenna bwe yeerowooza okuba owa waggulu so nga si bw’ali, yeerimbarimba. <verse eid="GAL 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4"/>Naye buli muntu yeekebere akakase omulimu ggwe, yenyumirize ye yekka so si mu muntu omulala. <verse eid="GAL 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5"/>Kubanga buli muntu aneetikkanga obuvunaanyizibwa bwe. <verse eid="GAL 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6"/>Oyo ayigirizibwa ekigambo kya Katonda, agabanirenga wamu n’amuyigiriza ku birungi byonna by’alina.<verse eid="GAL 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7"/>Temubuzibwabuzibwanga, Katonda tasekererwa, kubanga omuntu ky’asiga era ky’alikungula. <verse eid="GAL 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8"/>Kubanga oyo asiga eri omubiri gwe, alikungula ebiggwaawo. Naye oyo asiga eri omwoyo, alikungula obulamu obutaggwaawo. <verse eid="GAL 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9"/>Kale tulemenga okuterebuka mu kukola obulungi, kubanga oluvannyuma tulikungula emikisa, bwe tutaggwaamu maanyi. <verse eid="GAL 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10"/>Noolwekyo, buli lwe kinaabanga kisobose tukolerenga abantu bonna ebirungi, na ddala ab’omu nnyumba ey’okukkiriza.<verse eid="GAL 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Si Kukomola Wabula Abantu Abaggya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11"/>Mulabe, bwe nnabawandiikira n’omukono gwange mu nnukuta ennene! <verse eid="GAL 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12"/>Abo abanoonya okweraga mu mubiri be babawaliriza okukomolebwa mu mubiri, balemenga okuyigganyizibwanga olw’omusaalaba gwa Kristo, balyoke beenyumirize olw’omubiri gwammwe. <verse eid="GAL 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13"/>Kubanga n’abo bennyini abakomolebwa tebakwata mateeka, naye baagala mukomolebwe balyoke beenyumirize olw’omubiri gwammwe. <verse eid="GAL 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14"/>Naye nze sigenda kwenyumiririza mu kintu kyonna okuggyako omusaalaba gwa Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo, kubanga olw’omusaalaba ogwo, nkomereddwa eri ensi, n’ensi ekomereddwa eri nze. <verse eid="GAL 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15"/>Kubanga okukomolebwa oba obutakomolebwa si kintu, wabula ekikulu kye kitonde ekiggya. <verse eid="GAL 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16"/>N’abo bonna abanaatambuliranga mu tteeka eryo, emirembe gibeerenga ku bo, n’okusaasirwa, ne ku Isirayiri ya Katonda.<verse eid="GAL 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17"/>Okuva kaakano tewabanga muntu n’omu anteganya, kubanga nnina enkovu za Yesu ku mubiri gwange.<verse eid="GAL 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18"/>Abooluganda, ekisa kya Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo kibeerenga nammwe n’omwoyo gwammwe. Amiina.<verse eid="GAL 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6"/>
</usx>
